04Z","closed_at":"2021-06-22T14:19:17Z","author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"<!-- Ignoring this template may result in your bug report getting deleted -->\r\n\r\nOn the dev branch, on [ui.three.js](https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js/blob/dev/editor/js/libs/ui.three.js#L39), and also on the master branch same [ui.three.js](https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js/blob/master/editor/js/libs/ui.three.js#L39) file, there's an event listener being added that uses the `event` variable inside the callback function, but that parameter isn't present.\r\n\r\n***Code***\r\n\r\n```\r\ncanvas.addEventListener( 'drop', function () {\r\n\r\n\tevent.preventDefault();\r\n\tevent.stopPropagation();\r\n\tloadFile( event.dataTransfer.files[ 0 ] );\r\n\r\n}, false );\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Expected**\r\n\r\nCallback function with the parameter `event` as used inside.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncanvas.addEventListener( 'drop', function ( event ) {\r\n\r\n\tevent.preventDefault();\r\n\tevent.stopPropagation();\r\n\tloadFile( event.dataTransfer.files[ 0 ] );\r\n\r\n}, false );\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Platform:**\r\n\r\nDetected on Three.js version [master, r126], still present on [dev, r129] and [master, r129].\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Mugen87","id":12612165,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNjEyMTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12612165?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mugen87","html_url":"https://github.com/Mugen87","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mugen87/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mugen87/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mugen87/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mugen87/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mugen87/subscriptions","organizations_url":"h